<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala B up 23.29 pct on bargain hunting.</title>
<headline>Ayala B up 23.29 pct on bargain hunting.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Corp B gained 4.25 pesos, or by 23.29 percent, to 22.50 pesos in late Manila trade on Monday as foreign funds bought back the issue after it has fallen to bargain levels, traders said.  </p>
<p>The A shares, open to Filipinos only, also soared by 23.29 percent, or by 4.25 pesos, to 22.50.</p>
<p>&quot;There's bottom-fishing on blue chips like Ayala,&quot; said Monique Lecaros, trader at Sun Hung Kai Securities.</p>
<p>Some 10.98 million Ayala Corp B shares and 126,800 A shares changed hands.</p>
<p>--MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-62-67</p>
